  "id": "chicken-vindaloo",
  "name": "Chicken Vindaloo",
  "subtitle": "A tangy, warmly spiced chicken curry",
  "description": "Chicken is marinated with lemon, garlic, and ginger, then cooked with toasted spices, onion, tomato, and chili until tender.",
